age. \\n\\n  * <::marker>Issue template path: .gitlab/issue_templates/Internal_Outage.md \\n  * <::marker>Scope: Internal services, hosts, and network interfaces \\n  * <::marker>Audience: Engineers, SREs, on-call responders \\n\\n\\n\\nHow to use \\n\\n  1. <::marker>Create a new issue. \\n  2. <::marker>Choose the \"Internal_Outage\" template. \\n  3. <::marker>Fill out all sections with the most up-to-date information available. \\n\\n\\n\\nWhy this exists \\n\\n  * <::marker>Standardized reports improve signal quality during incidents. \\n  * <::marker>Ensures networking, logging, dependency, and rollback details are captured. \\n  * <::marker>Enables faster handoffs and post-incident reviews. \\n\\n\\n', url='http://the-agent-company.com:8929/root/devops-issue-template/-/tree/main', trigger_by_action='browse_interactive', error=True, observation='browse', goal_image_urls=[], open_pages_urls=['http://the-agent-company.com:8929/root/devops-issue-template/-/tree/main'], active_page_index=0, last_browser_action=\"click('713')\\nnoop(800)\\nclick('721')\\nnoop(1200)\\nscroll(0, 800)\\nnoop(800)\", last_browser_action_error='ValueError: Could not find element with bid \"721\"', focused_element_bid='713'), BrowseInteractiveAction(browser_actions=\"click('725')\\nnoop(1200)\\nscroll(0, 800)\\nnoop(800)\\nscroll(0, 800)\\nnoop(800)\\nscroll(0, 800)\\nnoop(800)\", thought='', browsergym_send_msg_to_user='', action='browse_interactive', security_risk=None), BrowserOutputObservation(content=\"Skip to main content \\n\\n##  Primary navigation \\n\\n[ Homepage  ](/)\\n\\nCreate new... \\n\\n  * In this project \\n\\n    * [ New issue  ](/root/devops-issue-template/-/issues/new)\\n    * [ New merge request  ](/root/devops-issue-template/-/merge_requests/new)\\n    * [ New snippet  ](/root/devops-issue-template/-/snippets/new)\\n    * Invite team members \\n  * In GitLab \\n\\n    * [ New project/repository  ](/projects/new)\\n    * [ New group  ](/groups/new)\\n    * [ New sn