-issue-template-main.tar)\\n\\n\\n\\nCopy HTTP clone URL \\n\\n  * [ **Copy SSH clone URL** ssh://git@the-agent-company.com:2424/root/devops-issue-template.git  ](ssh://git@the-agent-company.com:2424/root/devops-issue-template.git)\\n  * [ **Copy HTTP clone URL** http://the-agent-company.com:8929/root/devops-issue-template.git  ](http://the-agent-company.com:8929/root/devops-issue-template.git)\\n\\n\\n\\n[ docs: add internal resource links, dashboards, and on-call info ](/root/devops-issue-template/-/commit/80a426697710dc5e7c2485473beb035cc1b16b14)\\n\\nopenhands authored  7 minutes ago \\n\\n80a42669 \\n\\nName  |  Last commit  |  Last update   \\n---|---|---  \\n[ <::before> .gitlab  ](/root/devops-issue-template/-/tree/main/.gitlab?ref_type=heads \".gitlab\") |  [ Add internal outage issue template and README ](/root/devops-issue-template/-/commit/3940f5756399782a0c912295b4920da78af1641f \"Add internal outage issue template and README\\n\") |  11 minutes ago   \\n[ <::before> README.md  ](/root/devops-issue-template/-/blob/main/README.md?ref_type=heads \"README.md\") |  [ docs: add internal resource links, dashboards, and on-call info ](/root/devops-issue-template/-/commit/80a426697710dc5e7c2485473beb035cc1b16b14 \"docs: add internal resource links, dashboards, and on-call info\\n\") |  7 minutes ago   \\n  \\n[ **README.md** ](/root/devops-issue-template/-/blob/main/README.md?ref_type=heads)\\n\\n#  <::after> DevOps Internal Outage Reports \\n\\nThis repository provides a shared issue template for reporting internal outages across our infrastructure. Use it to quickly capture the right details, reduce back-and-forth, and accelerate incident triage. \\n\\n  * <::marker>Issue template path: .gitlab/issue_templates/Internal_Outage.md \\n  * <::marker>Scope: Internal services, hosts, and network interfaces \\n  * <::marker>Audience: Engineers, SREs, on-call responders \\n\\n\\n\\nHow to use \\n\\n  1. <::marker>Create a new issue. \\n  2. <::marker>Choose the \"Internal_Outage\" template. \\n  3. <::marker>Fill out all sections with the most up-to-date information available. \\n\\n\\n\\nWhy this exists \\n\\n  * <::marker>Standardized reports improve signal quality during incidents. \\n  * <::marker>Ensures networking, logging, dependency, and rollback details are captured. \\n  * <::marker>Enables faster handoffs and post-incident reviews. \\n\\n\\n\\nInternal resources (examples) \\n\\n  * <::marker>Runbooks \\n    * <::marker>Auth Proxy: [ http://the-agent-company.com:8929/helpdesk/runbooks/auth-proxy ](http://the-agent-company.com:8929/helpdesk/runbooks/auth-proxy)\\n    * <::marker>Network Troubleshooting: [ http://the-agent-company.com:8929/helpdesk/runbooks/network-triage ](http://the-agent-company.com:8929/helpdesk/runbooks/network-triage)\\n  * <::marker>Dashboards \\n    * <::marker>Infra Overview: [ http://grafana.the-agent-company.com/d/infra/overview ](http://grafana.the-agent-company.com/d/infra/overview)\\n    * <::marker>Auth Proxy Service: [ http://grafana.the-agent-company.com/d/auth-proxy/latency-error ](http://grafana.the-agent-company.com/d/auth-proxy/latency-error)\\n  * <::marker>On-call rotation \\n    * <::marker>SRE On-call: [ http://the-agent-company.com:8929/helpdesk/oncall/sre ](http://the-agent-company.com:8929/helpdesk/oncall/sre)\\n    * <::marker>Platform On-call: [ http://the-agent-company.com:8929/helpdesk/oncall/platform ](http://the-agent-company.com:8929/helpdesk/oncall/platform)\\n\\n\\n\\nNote: Replace the above links with your actual internal resources if they differ. \\n\\nExample incident quick start \\n\\n  * <::marker>If auth-proxy is failing health checks: \\n    1. <::marker>Check dashboards above for spikes in 5xx/latency. \\n    2. <::marker>Review logs at /var/log/auth.log on affected hosts. \\n    3. <::marker>Verify network security rules and interface status (e.g., iptables, routes, NIC errors). \\n    4. <::marker>Capture findings using the Internal_Outage issue template. 